<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Login | GLBITM Hostel Complaint Portal</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* button colours: must beat ".theme a" */
    a.btn.btn-primary, a.btn.btn-primary:hover { color: #0e1320; }
    a.btn.btn-ghost, a.btn.btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text); }

    /* navbar */
    .topbar { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .topbar .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; height: 84px; }
    .topbar img { height: 56px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
    .topbar nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
    .topbar nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
    .topbar nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .topbar nav a.on { color: var(--text); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
    .topbar .actions { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 10px; }

    /* hero */
    .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; right: -140px; top: -120px; width: 460px; height: 460px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--border); opacity: 0.7; }
    .hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -90px; bottom: -110px; width: 260px; height: 260px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--border); opacity: 0.6; }
    .hero .wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; padding-top: 64px; padding-bottom: 72px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .hero h1 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); }
    .hero p.lead { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 0 32px; }
    .hero .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .mini { display: flex; gap: 28px; margin-top: 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .mini b { display: block; color: var(--text); font: 700 1.5rem var(--font-head); }

    /* login card */
    .login-card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; }
    .login-card h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .login-card .sub { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .login-card .field { border-color: #44516f; }
    .login-card .field::placeholder { color: #8590a8; }
    .group { margin-top: 18px; }
    .pw { position: relative; }
    .pw .field { padding-right: 64px; }
    .pw button { position: absolute; right: 8px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); background: none; border: 0; color: var(--muted); font: 600 0.8rem var(--font-body); cursor: pointer; padding: 6px 8px; }
    .pw button:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .alert { margin-top: 16px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #ff8a94; background: rgba(240, 97, 109, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(240, 97, 109, 0.4); }
    .login-card .foot { margin-top: 22px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* how it works */
    .how { padding: 72px 0 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .how h2 { text-align: center; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .how .sub { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 40px; }
    .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .feat { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s; }
    .feat:hover { background: var(--surface-hover); border-color: #44516f; }
    .feat svg { width: 52px; height: 52px; stroke: var(--accent); fill: none; stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .feat h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .feat p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.92rem; }

    /* footer */
    .pagefoot { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 24px 0; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .pagefoot strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .topbar nav { display: none; }
      .hero .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 48px; }
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .topbar .wrap { height: 72px; gap: 12px; }
      .topbar img { height: 44px; }
      .topbar .actions .btn-ghost { display: none; }
      .login-card { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .mini { gap: 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="theme">

  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <img src="/college-logo.png" alt="GLBITM logo" />
      <nav>
        <a href="#top" class="on">Home</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="/admin/login">Warden login</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" href="/user/login">Sign in</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/user/register">Join now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div>
          <h1>Hostel<br /><em>Complaint</em> Portal</h1>
          <p class="lead">The place where your hostel problems are heard. Report an issue with a photo, see who else is affected, and follow it until it is fixed.</p>
          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/user/register">Register complaint</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="#how">How it works</a>
          </div>
          <div class="mini">
            <div><b>24h</b>auto priority raise</div>
            <div><b>1 tap</b>"Me too" votes</div>
            <div><b>5 star</b>rate every fix</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="login-card" action="/user/login" method="POST">
          <h2>Welcome back</h2>
          <p class="sub">Log in with your scholar number.</p>

          <% if (typeof message !== "undefined" && message) { %>
            <div class="alert" role="alert"><%= message %></div>
          <% } %>

          <div class="group">
            <label class="label" for="scholarNumber">Scholar number</label>
            <input class="field" id="scholarNumber" name="scholarNumber" type="number" placeholder="e.g. 2201234" autocomplete="username" />
          </div>

          <div class="group">
            <label class="label" for="password">Password</label>
            <div class="pw">
              <input class="field" id="password" name="password" type="password" placeholder="Enter your password" autocomplete="current-password" />
              <button type="button" id="togglePw">Show</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg btn-block" style="margin-top:24px">Log in</button>

          <div class="foot">
            <span>New here? <a href="/user/register">Create account</a></span>
            <span>Warden? <a href="/admin/login">Admin login</a></span>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how" id="how">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>From complaint to fixed</h2>
        <p class="sub">Three steps, and you can see where your complaint stands at every one of them.</p>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="feat">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20h4L19 9a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4L4 16v4z"/><path d="M13.5 6.5l4 4"/></svg>
            <h3>Submit your complaint</h3>
            <p>Pick a category, describe the problem and attach a photo.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feat">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"/><path d="M8.5 11h7M8.5 14h4"/></svg>
            <h3>Warden responds</h3>
            <p>The most affected issues rise to the top, and slow ones escalate on their own.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feat">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16.5 9.5"/></svg>
            <h3>Resolved, then rated</h3>
            <p>Rate the fix, or reopen the complaint if the problem still exists.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="pagefoot">
    <div class="wrap">
      Developed by <strong>Harsh Kumar Singh</strong><br />
      GL Bajaj Institute of Technology &amp; Management, Greater Noida
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    var pw = document.getElementById("password");
    var tg = document.getElementById("togglePw");
    tg.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var show = pw.type === "password";
      pw.type = show ? "text" : "password";
      tg.textContent = show ? "Hide" : "Show";
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>